# Local databases, backups, exports, fixtures
# The app's own artifacts: SQLCipher vault + WAL, header, backups, exports.
# Keep this list in sync with the paths in src-tauri/src (vault.rs, demo/mod.rs,
# services/backups.rs, services/exports.rs); it is the last line of defense
# against committing a vault, backup, or plaintext ledger export.
*.cmdb
*.cmdb-wal
*.cmdb-shm
*.cmdb-journal
*.cmdb.restore-old
*.cmbak
